{"4041730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Something Beautiful", "steam_appid": 4041730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BECOME SOMETHING BEAUTIFUL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken disoriented in a socially fractured industrial estate. As the fog lifts from your mind, your search for answers reveals hidden secrets and a story that will carry you far beyond the city walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041730/extras/2504a614235a05bbe3b46409aa229515.poster.avif?t=1788217749\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041730/extras/2504a614235a05bbe3b46409aa229515.webm?t=1788217749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041730/extras/2504a614235a05bbe3b46409aa229515.mp4?t=1788217749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore an Atmospheric world</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam through detailed industrial estates, descend into the sewers beneath them, and discover what lurks beyond Coil City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041730/extras/3f06379ac4a00a075adf8e970901fe72.poster.avif?t=1788217749\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041730/extras/3f06379ac4a00a075adf8e970901fe72.webm?t=1788217749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041730/extras/3f06379ac4a00a075adf8e970901fe72.mp4?t=1788217749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve musical puzzles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entire album is embedded into the game world — from interactive music puzzles to surreal “Flesh Disk” jukeboxes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041730/extras/d57a6b11ea5e494759e305dcf9f5ab1e.poster.avif?t=1788217749\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041730/extras/d57a6b11ea5e494759e305dcf9f5ab1e.webm?t=1788217749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041730/extras/d57a6b11ea5e494759e305dcf9f5ab1e.mp4?t=1788217749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by visual artist and musician Murlo, Something Beautiful fuses music, visual art and sculpture into a haunting, handcrafted experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of Cronenberg’s body adaptations,, Kafka’s transformations, William Blake’s esoteric visions and Lynchian dreams.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BECOME SOMETHING BEAUTIFUL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken disoriented in a socially fractured industrial estate. As the fog lifts from your mind, your search for answers reveals hidden secrets and a story that will carry you far beyond the city walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041